/**
 * Every priced dish on the canteen's menu boards, read from 64 photos taken
 * on 21 October 2569 (2026). One photo set per stall, named by stall number
 * (3A, 3B and so on), kept in the TUSU Google Drive canteen folder.
 *
 * The Thai and English names, prices and size or topping variants are as
 * the boards show them. Type, course, protein, cooking style,
 * temperature and "wet" were judged from the name and the picture: nobody
 * asked the stalls. "contains" is a deliberately broad guess at allergens
 * (fish sauce, soy sauce, shrimp paste and batter included): it errs
 * towards listing too much and is never a guarantee. Vegetarian is true only where the board says so or the item plainly
 * has no meat, fish or seafood.
 *
 * Generated from the transcription and mirrored, row for row, in
 * data/canteen-survey.csv for the Sanity importer. Change both together.
 */

